OL,3,GNEWSAOccupation-era road sign uncovered
OL,4,Aby decorators
OL,5,
OL,6,FA road sign dating back more than 80
OL,7,Fyears to the German Occupation of
OL,8,FGuernsey has been uncovered on the
OL,9,Fboundary wall of a property.
OL,11,FDecorators made the discovery while
OL,12,Fworking on the building in Elm Grove,
OL,13,FSt Peter Port, and notified World War
OL,14,FTwo fortification restoration group
OL,15,FFestung Guernsey.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
