OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F442A1790335587
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+jp5w{j#57kjs15  jjs1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.* %%** %%**,$-, *(,% ,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAOccupation-era road sign uncovered
OL,4,Aby decorators
OL,5,
OL,6,FChairman Paul Bourgaize said the sign,
OL,7,Fwhich formed part of a road map created
OL,8,Fby German forces around the island,
OL,9,Fmarked a "very important part of
OL,10,FGuernsey's history" and served as "a
OL,11,Freminder of the five years of
OL,12,Foccupation that the locals went
OL,13,Fthrough".
OL,15,FHe said the owners of the property were
OL,16,Fkeen to preserve the sign, with the
OL,17,Fgroup set to stabilise what was left.
